{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に中田が出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ久しぶりだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4か月以上空いたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈に琴子に中田です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の「の」\n文化放送\n7月17日(日) 18時～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに\nShout it Outから\n露口 仁也さんと細川 千弘さんが来て下さいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対照的なお二人だと思ったけど\nお二人ともバンドへの思いはしっかりあって\n素敵だなと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"景気のいい話ってことで\nお金の話とか株の話とか\nたくさん話しちゃいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドープ君は\n先週いただいた\nANARCHYさんの『BLKFLG』で勉強中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週、楽しみにしてても\nあっという間に終わっちゃう沈金ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は沈金出れずです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に出たかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話出演はしたいと思ってるので\n来週も気を抜かずに聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/17/1309346/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}